  "ID": "36140",
  "post_title": "Onda es volca en la campanya 'En Valencià', malgrat la pluja",
  "post_date": "2013-04-25 18:57:46",
  "post_name": "onda-es-volca-en-la-campanya-en-valencia-malgrat-la-pluja",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>Onda s&#39;ha volcat la vesprada d&#39;aquest dijous en la campanya &#39;En Valenci&agrave;&#39;, organitzada per l&#39;&agrave;rea de Cultura i Educaci&oacute; de l&#39;Ajuntament, i l&#39;Acad&egrave;mia Valenciana de la Llengua (AVL), que s&#39;ha traslladat al Centre d&#39;Ocupaci&oacute; i Cultura, a causa de la pluja.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/04/IMG_6112.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>De16.30 a 19.30 hores han passat moltes persones que han pogut fer sopes de lletres sobre pobles valencinas, animals, pa&iuml;sos o arbres. Com a premi se&#39;ls donava una s&egrave;rie de materials en valenci&agrave;, que inlo&iuml;en un futllet de topon&iacute;mia d&#39;Onda, unes xapetes i una samarreta de la campanya.</p>\n<p>Tamb&eacute; s&#39;ha pogut fer un joc de lletres gegant, a c&agrave;rrec principalment de l&#39;alumnat de valenci&agrave; del centre de Formaci&oacute; de Persones Adultes (FPA), amb el seu professor, Josep Antoni Meneu al front, mentre els observava la majoria de l&#39;equip de govern de l&#39;Ajuntament.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyaenvalenciaonda/img_6040.jpg\" alt=\"img_6040\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyaenvalenciaonda/img_6041.jpg\" alt=\"img_6041\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyaenvalenciaonda/img_6042.jpg\" alt=\"img_6042\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyaenvalenciaonda/img_6043.jpg\" alt=\"img_6043\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyaenvalenciaonda/img_6044.jpg\" alt=\"img_6044\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyaenvalenciaonda/img_6045.jpg\" alt=\"img_6045\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyaenvalenciaonda/img_6046.jpg\" alt=\"img_6046\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyaenvalenciaonda/img_6047.jpg\" alt=\"img_6047\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyaenvalenciaonda/img_6048.jpg\" alt=\"img_6048\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyaenvalenciaonda/img_6049.jpg\" alt=\"img_6049\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyaenvalenciaonda/img_6050.jpg\" alt=\"img_6050\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyaenvalenciaonda/img_6051.jpg\" alt=\"img_6051\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyaenvalenciaonda/img_6052.jpg\" alt=\"img_6052\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyaenvalenciaonda/img_6053.jpg\" alt=\"img_6053\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyaenvalenciaonda/img_6054.jpg\" alt=\"img_6054\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyaenvalenciaonda/img_6055.jpg\" alt=\"img_6055\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyaenvalenciaonda/img_6056.jpg\" alt=\"img_6056\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyaenvalenciaond